OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FShowmen Mike and Danny host at the
OL,7,     Ffour-star Homecliffe Hotel in
OL,8,     FBlackpool. Sylvie and Alan have a
OL,9,     Fgreat view... of the local car
OL,10,     Fwash. And at breakfast, Eva sends
OL,11,     Fher food back twice!
OL,12,G2025 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day and the B&Bers
OL,14,     Fmeet one last time to find out how
OL,15,     Fmuch they've been paid. Only one
OL,16,     Festablishment can take the title
OL,17,     Fof best value for money B&B. Who
OL,18,     Fwill it be?
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/5
