OL,5,G2100 Surgeons: Life in Their Hands
OL,6,     FSingle mum Tracy faces a
OL,7,     Flife-and-death battle with a rare
OL,8,     Fand aggressive brain cancer. And
OL,9,     Fwe meet Kylie, who's
OL,10,     Frevolutionising emergency stroke
OL,11,     Fcare.
OL,12,G2200 Police Rescue
OL,13,     FSpecialist bomb technicians travel
OL,14,     Fto a secret location in rural New
OL,15,     FSouth Wales to detonate
OL,16,     Fsurrendered explosives used in the
OL,17,     Fmining industry. (Ep3/6)
