OL,5,G2255 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FStephen, who's 48, has severely
OL,7,     Fdamaged his ankle after coming off
OL,8,     Fhis bike in the woods. Derek has
OL,9,     Fhad a suspected stroke. Bridget
OL,10,     Fbroke her wrist on a mountain path
OL,11,     Fin Greece.
OL,12,G0000 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FParamedics are called to a
OL,14,     Fsuspected drugs overdose, and a
OL,15,     Fman with a deep cut on his head
OL,16,     Frefuses to go to hospital for fear
OL,17,     Fthat he won't come out again.
